NOTE: the harness caught + fixed two real latent type defects before they could ship —
  (1) DriveScoreAchievement/DriveScoreTip declared Hashable+Sendable while holding a
      non-Hashable/non-Sendable LocalizedStringKey (now Identifiable only);
  (2) `Double % Int` (unavailable) in a pagination fixture (now truncatingRemainder).

